38,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T19:23:13Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T19:23:13Z","body":"Regression from #111965, CC @Ivorforce.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4100491104/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4100538821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117676#issuecomment-4100538821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117676","id":4100538821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70aUHF","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T19:34:24Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T19:34:24Z","body":"CC also @ArchercatNEO as this implies code added for HDR support and modified in #111965.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4100538821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4100581242","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117676#issuecomment-4100581242","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117676","id":4100581242,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70aed6","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T19:41:40Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T19:41:40Z","body":"The `memnew` should not have been wrapped with a `Ref<>` here, once the Ref goes out of scope it's freed because we leave the `if` but the ptr needs to still be valid.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4a280218fcfdd69408cceb74577c9e69086be23a/platform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_thread.cpp#L2718-L2731\n\nThe implied logic is that we create a `ColorProfileMessage` and then transfer ownership to the image listener description, eventually we're done listening to events and we can claim ownership of the ptr again, pushing a `Ref<ColorProfileMessage>` to a queue that `DisplayServerWayland` consumes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4100581242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4100622636","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117676#issuecomment-4100622636","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117676","id":4100622636,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70aoks","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T19:49:12Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T19:49:29Z","body":"This block of code in `_wp_image_description_on_ready2` is intended to \"leak\" the `Ref<ColorProfileMessage>` and turn it into a raw pointer so that in `_wp_image_description_info_on_done` we can \"unleak\" it and get the `Ref<>` back.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4a280218fcfdd69408cceb74577c9e69086be23a/platform/linuxbsd/wayland/wayland_thread.cpp#L2733-L2740","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4100622636/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4101520031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117676#issuecomment-4101520031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117676","id":4101520031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70eDqf","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-21T00:00:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-21T00:00:24Z","body":"I don't know how hacky this would be, but I guess that simply manually `reference()`ing and `unreference()`ing the actual object should achieve what you want @ArchercatNEO.\n\nSomething like:\n\n```cpp\n \tif (image_info != nullptr) { \n \t\tRef<ColorProfileMessage> msg = memnew(ColorProfileMessage);\n \t\tmsg->id = ws->id; \n \t\tmsg->wayland_thread = ws->wayland_thread;\n\n \t\t// We're going to keep this object around for a bit.\n \t\tmsg.ptr().reference();\n   \t\twp_image_description_info_v1_add_listener(image_info, &wp_image_description_info_listener, msg.ptr()); \n \t\twp_image_description_v1_destroy(image_descriptor); \n \t} \n```\n\n```cpp\n void WaylandThread::_wp_image_description_info_on_done(void *data, struct wp_image_description_info_v1 *wp_image_description_info_v1) { \n \twp_image_description_info_v1_destroy(wp_image_description_info_v1); \n  \n \tColorProfileMessage *msg = (ColorProfileMessage *)data; \n \tERR_FAIL_NULL(msg); \n  \n \tmsg->wayland_thread->push_message(msg);\n\n \t// This object was manually referenced while it was callback data.\n  \tmsg->unreference();\n }\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4101520031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4101546062","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117676#issuecomment-4101546062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117676","id":4101546062,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70eKBO","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-21T00:09:13Z","updated_at":"2026-03-21T00:12:27Z","body":"Ah, sorry about this. I guess it was inevitable I misinterpret a caller with a change like this.\nI'm not using wayland so this will be hard to debug for me, but I'll try to have a look and trace the lifecycle of the involved data.\n\nJust to be clear, I'm definitely convinced it _should_ be working with `Ref` instead of pointer. The question is just how.\n\nEdit: Reading up above, it sounds like the problem is a smart pointer to non-smart-pointer boundary. Manually referencing and unreferencing is a bit unsafe, but it is definitely better than what the code did previously (not reference and hope nobody references it while it's a `void *` (because that would create a crash).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4101546062/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]